[xUnit.net 00:02:27.77]       Nightly ChaosRandom/Stress tier: slow for the PR suite, and surfaces an unresolved leader-side commit hole under continuous multi-partition faults. Out-of-order per-proposal commit (RaftWriteAhead.EnqueueCommit advances commitIndex non-contiguously) strands an entry as Proposed below the leader's in-memory frontier; GetRangeAsync (Committed-only) can never re-ship it, so followers buffer later entries over the permanent hole and convergence times out. Needs a commit-model fix (gap-aware leader commit + stalled-proposal re-drive). The non-contiguous-delivery bug and the CommitMonotonicity dip artifact it was previously blocked on are both fixed.
[xUnit.net 00:02:27.78]       Nightly ChaosRandom/Stress tier: slow for the PR suite, and surfaces an unresolved leader-side commit hole under continuous multi-partition faults. Out-of-order per-proposal commit (RaftWriteAhead.EnqueueCommit advances commitIndex non-contiguously) strands an entry as Proposed below the leader's in-memory frontier; GetRangeAsync (Committed-only) can never re-ship it, so followers buffer later entries over the permanent hole and convergence times out. Needs a commit-model fix (gap-aware leader commit + stalled-proposal re-drive). The non-contiguous-delivery bug and the CommitMonotonicity dip artifact it was previously blocked on are both fixed.
